      <activity id="b5fb6921-02c4-547f-bd1d-3eca9cbb468e" activityNameId="6ace7056-384c-5e0f-a15e-31fb8cbb43df" activityNameContextId="f44c43c1-5cc5-54a6-ade6-24435bd12c83" type="1" specialActivityType="0" energyValues="0">
        <activityName xml:lang="en">Maintenance, electric scooter, without battery</activityName>
        <generalComment>
          <text xml:lang="en" index="1">Full activity name: Maintenance, electric scooter, without battery
The data reflects the replacement of parts for the maintenance of an e-scooter of 144kg with a LiIo battery pack. Mainly the battery,  plastic and steel parts are replaced. The battery is assumed to be replaced once during the life time of the e-scooter. The battery replacement is not included in this dataset and needs to be accounted for separately.;
UUID: 0eec6898-1c96-384d-9be5-9d8003c67cc9
This data sets includes the maintenance of an electric scooter throughout its life cycle.
Location: Data cover maintenance in Switzerland
Technology: Maintenance of an electric scooter (max. 60-70km/h)
Time period: undefined
Production volume: na
Sampling: Literature 
Extrapolations: none
Uncertainty adjustments: none
BAFU mapped export: unsupported biosphere exchanges excluded; see audit/. Local UUIDs and generic activity classification are export conventions. Source: process_0eec6898-1c96-384d-9be5-9d8003c67cc9.xml</text>
        </generalComment>
      </activity>
